  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nI love Homarr, and use the open all in each category, everyday. It would be great to have a single dropdown at the top of Homarr that would open ALL of the apps in ALL of the categories in new tabs; rather than going into each cat and clicking open all.\n\nThank you for the great work!\n\n### Additional information\n\nOriginally posted https://github.com/ajnart/homarr/issues/1928",
